# ── Local server data dir (never commit) ───────────────────────────────────
# If you run the server with a repo-local --data-dir, the SQLite DB, config/
# (including the AES-GCM server key K — losing it loses all vault secrets),
# backup/ and logs/ land here. Keep dev data out of the repo:
# .data/
# hyveman-dev-data/
